Package: com.you.26animsafe
Name: 26AnimSafe (Fluid Open/Close)
Version: 1.0.0-4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: iOS 26-style app open/close zoom for iOS 13-15 (rootless). Hooks each *IconZoomAnimator -settings and retunes the real SBFAnimationSettings.duration (centralAnimationSettings/appZoomSettings/appFadeSettings/...). Crash-proof: every call guarded, per-class IMP capture.
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Maintainer: you <you@example.com>
Author: you
Section: Tweaks
